{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-planck-limits","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:planck-limits","kind":"remark","title":"Limiting regimes of $\\hbar_q$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quantum-planck-constant"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quantum-planck-constant","tags":["planck","limits"],"text":"planck-limits.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"rem:planck-limits\"></a>\n<strong>Remark.</strong> <em>Limiting regimes of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hbar_q</code></em></p>\n<p>As <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\to 1</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hbar_q \\to 0</code> and quantum effects vanish. As <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\to \\infty</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hbar_q \\to 1</code>.</p>\n"}
